      en: ["Located in Busia District on the eastern edge of Lake Victoria.", "Historically served as an important export port for raw materials to Kenya.", "Situated in close proximity to the international border.", "The area is a major center for artisanal fishing activities.", "Features extensive sandy beaches intended for tourism development.", "Targeted for modernization under regional integration projects."],
